{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Generate a three-column product feature section designed to showcase a single featured product, built to dynamically pull content from the product's data and section settings.
    
    Layout & Dynamic Content Mapping:
    Left Column (Benefits/Icons): Design as a section setting block where the content (e.g., '5x better uptake,' 'Train harder') and corresponding icon/color can be manually input by the user. Visually, present this as a vertical, attention-grabbing list of four key benefits next to simple, distinct icons.
    
    Center Column (Media): This column must be assigned to display the Featured Image of the linked Shopify product.
    
    Right Column (Product Details & CTA): Dynamically pull the Product Title, Product Description, Compare-at-Price, and Selling Price from the linked Shopify product. The pricing must also include a calculated percentage off badge next to the sale price.
    
    Custom Field: Include a line for the weight/serving size which is designed to pull from a dedicated product metafield (e.g., product.metafields.custom.weight).
    
    Action Elements: End this column with a Quantity Selector and the Add to Cart/Shop Now button.
    
    Header & Styling:
    Overall Header: "Amino Forge's AF 9" (This can be a section setting title).
    
    Aesthetic: Use a clean, three-column layout with a minimalist, high-end feel. The primary focus should be on the product image, with the benefits and purchase details clearly separated."
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

